    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Bart Sellitto",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109581473537133110517/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDJ-PChkeGL5vKQPm371NuAOcsHX4mBnERi7FtgP4o3BF61w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Been going to this location for over 4 years. For Spring and Fall tune up. Always we'll received and service was good ..never had to go back for any service they did. My Malibu and zi are quite pleased.  The staff is courteous and knowledgeable..",
        "time": 1684539722,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Roy S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105433532300197283418/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXmK9N23knzkOXXchf_buQmj6bVnibKbwx7EKUCTqtuLLt18P4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Great Service department.\nProfessional advice.\nPolite and knowledgeable staff.\nTerrific shuttle service.\nThe perfect place to get your Chevy vehicle repaired.\nThey are there for you when you need them.",
        "time": 1660335012,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hank Johnson (Hankster)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103574426570922879686/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWXpFbhsXh67SU21hyxyzB_3hxGbjlNKR1-Y_m4pxBt0q_rscj-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Had an issue with my car and even without an appointment they took care of me on a busy day. Great service. Thank you and much appreciated",
        "time": 1624924924,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Constantin Cristea",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116476717638323733747/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMsFqCp9I4EWQUUDIebuyxgpfephkeB33PX3CBXRLeIjD2MFy8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We just purchased a new 2021 Rav4 Hybrid from Toyota l'île Perrot.\nThat's our 4th Toyota in the last 12 years we are leasing or purchasing from this dealership.\nAs always, what a great experience.\nMr. Antoine Saade, our sales manager, answered every questions and concerns very professional.\nHe is knowledgeable and very respectful.\nHe was able to get us the new car within 3 days after our first visit. That was a very nice surprise.\nI would like also to mention also Mr. Payman from finance department, who took care of us very promptly and professionally. Also very knowledgeable and polite person.\nOverall, a great experience at Toyota l'île Perrot.\nI'm looking forward to the day I will be called for my new Rav4 Prime. I hope it will be soon.",
        "time": 1621005102,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brooks Yardley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108034478328503828383/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxJ9nra_YTl6cI9BEuSnXubuSh4v5DwwtM7maV30C-v7OjG8M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Do not trust their mechanic reports on used cars. They gave me a report that said brakes were at 50% and there was a non-serious issue with the exhaust that was optional to repair. After driving it for less than a month I took it in for a check-up and found the brakes were totally shot, and the catalytic converter was busted. Bought the car (2005 Vibe) for about $2000 and now have to spend $1500 to get it in safe working condition. Liars and thieves (and it's also/alternatively possible that my mechanic is a liar and a thief, but considering his reputation I think that's less likely. I don't know who to trust these days...) Not recommended.",
        "time": 1572364339,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
